1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
Paris, Idade Média.

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:02,780
Você dá um passo...

3
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:03,740
e o pé afunda

4
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:05,520
na lama até o tornozelo.

5
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,580
Lama fedida,

6
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:08,200
revirada pelas carroças.

7
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,580
Nenhum calçamento.

8
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:10,120
Tá achando

9
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,300
que rico vivia melhor?

10
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:13,450
Rico fugia da lama.

11
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:15,010
Morava no castelo.

12
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:15,370
Mas lá

13
00:00:15,370 --> 00:00:16,050
o banheiro era

14
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:17,670
um buraco na parede.

15
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:19,990
Tudo caía direto no fosso.

16
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:20,710
E o nome desse

17
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:22,510
buraco é a melhor parte.

18
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:27,540
Dizem que guardavam

19
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:29,260
as roupas ali de propósito.

20
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:29,700
O fedor

21
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,280
de amônia espantava traças

22
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,220
e pulgas.

23
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:32,760
Só que

24
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:34,040
os médicos tinham

25
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:35,900
uma teoria sobre esse fedor.

26
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:37,170
Pra eles,

27
00:00:37,170 --> 00:00:38,690
mau cheiro causava doença.

28
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:40,550
Ar podre trazia a peste.

29
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:41,850
Então quem podia levava

30
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:42,850
uma bolinha de perfume

31
00:00:42,850 --> 00:00:43,670
no cinto.

32
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:44,590
Sem dinheiro?

33
00:00:44,590 --> 00:00:45,730
Laranja oca,

34
00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:46,890
esponja de vinagre,

35
00:00:46,890 --> 00:00:48,150
colada no nariz.

36
00:00:48,490 --> 00:00:50,070
Mas perfume nenhum salvou

37
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:50,650
o rei.

38
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:54,840
o rei Filipe Augusto

39
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,680
abriu a janela do palácio.

40
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:57,480
O fedor

41
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:58,600
da lama subiu pro

42
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,520
nariz do homem mais

43
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,000
poderoso da França.

44
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,340
Mandou pavimentar as ruas

45
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,140
de Paris. Todas?

46
00:01:04,630 --> 00:01:06,410
Não. Só as principais.

47
00:01:06,410 --> 00:01:06,630
A rua

48
00:01:06,630 --> 00:01:08,690
do lado continuou engolindo pé.

49
00:01:08,690 --> 00:01:09,710
Então esse povo nunca

50
00:01:09,710 --> 00:01:11,310
tomava banho, certo?

51
00:01:11,310 --> 00:01:13,110
Errado. No século seguinte,

52
00:01:13,110 --> 00:01:13,650
Paris tinha mais

53
00:01:13,650 --> 00:01:14,650
de trinta casas

54
00:01:14,650 --> 00:01:15,810
de banho públicas.

55
00:01:15,810 --> 00:01:16,830
O problema nunca foi

56
00:01:16,830 --> 00:01:17,430
o banho.

57
00:01:17,430 --> 00:01:18,210
Era a rua.
